---
name: migrate-foo
inputs:
  - path: git@github.com:org/legacy-foo.git
    kind: legacy-code
---

Migrate the legacy `mono-repo-foo` TypeScript monolith onto the
Augentic platform. The migration carves the monolith into a backend
service (Omnia) and a mobile app (Vectis Crux), with a shared HTTP
contract spanning the boundary.

The legacy monolith contains every flow this initiative targets:
user accounts, order processing, the storefront, and the checkout
funnel. The plan-skill discovery brief proposes a two-project
topology; the propose brief decomposes it into one contract change
and two implementation changes (one per project).
